# server.env.example - Every server setting of the CONNX MCP Server Community Edition.
#
# Copy this file to server.env and set the values for your site. A line "# KEY=value" shows the server default.
# To set a different value, remove the "# ". A line "# KEY=" has no server default. To set it, remove the "# " and
# give a value. A line "KEY=" without "# " is a setting that you must set. Keep the file private when it holds a
# secret. The file lists the server settings that connx-mcp-ce knows.
#
# Copyright:
#     Copyright 2026 Software GmbH
